{"product_id":"mr-men-my-teacher","title":"Mr Men: My Teacher","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Mr Men and Little Miss are here to show your teacher just how great you think they are. Who better to sum up all you'd like to say about your kind, clever and fun teacher?Children can also add their own words to make it a really personal gift. The perfect present to say thank you to a much-valued teacher at the end of the school year.The Mr Men and Little Miss have been delighting children for generations with their charming and funny antics. This new range of books which includes My Mummy and My Daddy is the perfect thank you gift for that special person in your life.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 251 x 228\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Roger Hargreaves\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405292856\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45862639075481,"sku":"17RE-1-9781405292856","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/69033767481d6_Mr_Men-_My_Teacher_Roger_Hargreaves.jpg?v=1762366432","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/mr-men-my-teacher","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}